<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 3,568 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 3,568 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble eased to 3,568 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,564 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    Sept 13		 Sept 12</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,568		   3,564</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    3.25		    3.16</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
